<title>HONG KONG: Four Seas Mercantile raises Yaohan stake.</title>
<headline>Four Seas Mercantile raises Yaohan stake.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four Seas Mercantile Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday it had agreed to buy 76.28 million shares, or 30.79 percent of Yaohan Food Processing &amp; Trading Co Ltd, for HK$54.92 million cash, or HK$0.72 per share.</p>
<p>It said the acquisition would increase its stake in Yaohan to about 40 percent from 9.21 percent and on completion Four Seas would launch a mandatory cash offer at HK$0.72 per share.</p>
</text>
